#X text 240 83 Two channel equal power panner. About is about 3dB center
reduction. With linear panning ([pan.lin~]) the signal is lowered as
it approaches center using a straight line from (+-)1 (left or right)
to 0 (center) for a 6dB reduction in the middle.;
#X text 240 168 A problem inherent to linear panning is that the perceived
volume of the signal drops in the middle. [pan.sqrt~] solves this.;
